{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51390","headline":"金庭洞 · 裴通","name":"金庭洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂金庭洞，清香发桂枝。\n鱼吞左慈钓，鹅踏右军池。\n（《永乐大典》一三○七四「洞」字韵（此诗未全，全篇见《全唐诗续拾》卷二六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴通","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}